---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_phase: contract not paused
    q_check_phase --> q_prefund: block.timestamp in prefund window
    q_check_phase --> q_active: block.timestamp in active sale window
    q_check_phase --> q_revert_timing: outside valid windows
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidSalePhase
    q_prefund --> q_verify_sig: verify Legion signer signature
    q_active --> q_verify_sig: verify Legion signer signature
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> [*]: totalCapitalInvested += amount, emit Invested

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: signature must be from authorized Legion signer
        INV-002: signature prevents replay (per-investor nonce or unique hash)
    end note

    note right of q_check_min
        INV-003: investment amount must meet minimum threshold
        INV-004: totalCapitalInvested increases monotonically during sale
    end note
